# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Next.js (apps/web-next), added with that app. The `dist` above does not cover it:
# Next writes its build to `.next/`. `next-env.d.ts` is regenerated by `next dev` /
# `next build` on every run, so tracking it only produces diffs; `*.tsbuildinfo` is the
# incremental-checkpoint file `incremental: true` writes next to `tsconfig.json`.
.next
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Vercel
.vercel

# Playwright run output for apps/web-next's e2e suite (stage S4-e). Scoped to that
# package on purpose: a bare `test-results/` line would ignore any future directory of
# that name in another app. `playwright-report/` is the HTML report the config's `html`
# reporter writes, `test-results/` the per-test attachments (outputDir in the config).
apps/web-next/playwright-report/
apps/web-next/test-results/

# Supabase local
.supabase

# Env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# tsx compile cache, created when tsx cannot resolve a cache dir and builds the
# path out of an undefined variable (the directory is literally named `undefined`).
# Untracked 2026-10-07; the files are still on disk, they are just not history anymore.
apps/api/undefined/
